<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-26T22:28:49.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF forces have intensified drone strikes, hitting a United Nations building and residential areas in Khartoum and killing four people, while a separate drone attack in Blue Nile state killed 19 civilians and displaced thousands near Ed Damazin. RSF-aligned troops assaulted aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties. A RSF counterintelligence chief and a commander defected to the Sudanese army in Khartoum, indicating shifting loyalties. Ethiopia offered to host inclusive Sudan peace talks and propose a national unity government, but Sudan rejected the offer, questioning Ethiopia's neutrality. The conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/26/lana-nusseibeh-uae-sudan-un-secretary-general&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5yQ0szY3JZTDN6WVlxckxwdHczb1FHbGF6b3JfYmJwQVJFV1NEZHFMbkNPRU9XSmRDSnRLZi1ZbmlmU2R0amhPelJxY3JRR0xJTHRWaUNZTDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQRnpfNzZZUGVhWjh1NGFCdDJQaTlGTl9RUWdXUHFPcFg4MmNObW9PREtfaGQ3R2lrN2Q1c3RySkc0SUJOSlNVMjNZS3JRWXQ2aE1EM25ZMmlKSVBzWUE2NnBEZW1xMW51QzdzZXRpTVdvX2lkMmJRaDBVUGYxWFN4NFJEMnVZT00wYlhXTnJNRWtDWGZiRm9TSURKa0JFejN3UUhKUEpzd3JWSlY3VVBSN1Nn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1wNm8wTnRvRFhfSERhU29WMG9vWk4wbkZCUlNIc0kyUm9zNVZvdEQyOUoyRHFIMExSSnpLUXQ3aGpYUWRRR0paYmZkV1M5UzNm?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95